    "image_with_text_HwKm4D": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Heg9Wq": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Meet our South Australia Trainer",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_kygpXA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At the helm of our Test & Tag courses in South Australia is Geoff Waugh, a seasoned professional with over 20 years of hands-on industry experience. Geoff brings unparalleled expertise in Test & Tag Standards, offering students deep, practical insights grounded in real-world applications.<br/><br/>What sets Geoff apart is his ability to make harder concepts easy to understand. He delivers courses in an approachable and engaging way, ensuring every student connects with the material. Geoff is committed to individualised learning, providing ample 1-on-1 time to address questions and ensure each participant gains the confidence and skills they need to succeed.<br/><br/>With Geoff’s guidance, students walk away with not just knowledge but also practical experience and the ability to apply Test & Tag confidently in their roles.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
